@format 1
@id queue.create-edit-work
@title Create active edit work
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Create edit work from the active unlocked media and current Crop and tone state, preserve its batch identity, then lock the accepted source.
@section I. UI
@tabs Edit
@flow TB
@related queue.create-saved-edit-work, queue.add-work, processing.source-output-collision

@alias ui = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LEdit
@alias edit = Cadroue.Application.LEdit
@alias courier = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LCourier

[input] Edit tab requests current work <input>
- Receive the active unlocked source, its relay batch, duration, Crop state, tone state, output preset, and relay routing @ ui.LEditDescribe(...)
- Convert the output preset into an edit work description @ ui.LEditDescribe(...)
> build

[build] Build active edit item <decision>
- Validate the source and create an output path that is changed when it would exactly equal the source @ edit.LEditItemsCreate(...)
- Create one work item with the current Crop and video state, reusing the source relay batch when supplied @ edit.LEditWorkCreate(...)
? "No valid item is created" > rejected
? "An item is created" > persist

[persist] Add durable work <storage>
- Add the item with relay target and source lineage, then lock its source only when persistence accepts it @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
- Record the queue result @ ui.LEditDescribe(...)
> result

[result] Active edit queued <output>
= The worklist contains the current edit plan, and its source is locked against resubmission or plan edits.

[rejected] Nothing queued <error>
= No edit work record is added.
